meta {
  name: Invite links - Update
  type: http
  seq: 223
}

patch {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/invite-links/<invite link cuid>
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "active": false
  }
}

docs {
  Changes an invite link (#1391): owner and admins. Only the fields of the request change; access_groups and member_tags replace the lists; null clears expires_at and max_uses. active false stops the link at once. A maximum at or below the count of the joins makes the link full. The people who joined before keep what they got. Token ability: invite-links:write.
}
